{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 30, "timestamp": 1788265120, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/zsh", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "title": "feature/02 — Failover: docker kill sul primario (~10 s)"}
[0.019421, "o", "./tools/failover-replicaset.sh spegni\r\n"]
[0.029631, "o", "\r\nPrima\r\n"]
[0.590218, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m primario: mongo-rs-1:27017\r\n"]
[0.590352, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m osservatore: mongo-rs-2\r\n"]
[1.314135, "o", "\r\nSpengo mongo-rs-1\r\n    \u001b[90mda dire ad alta voce: «sto SPEGNENDO un nodo», non «sto simulando un crash» (ADR-0034)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.490122, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m docker kill mongo-rs-1 — SIGKILL, nessun preavviso a nessuno\r\n\r\nL'elezione\r\n  \u001b[33m…\u001b[0m aspetto che mongo-rs-2 veda un primario diverso…\r\n"]
[10.657033, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m nuovo primario: mongo-rs-2:27017\r\n"]
[10.685171, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m elezione completata in 8617 ms (8.6 s)\r\n    \u001b[90mgiri in cui il set non aveva primario: 350\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.685255, "o", "\r\nIl container\r\n"]
[16.718694, "o", "  Status=exited RestartCount=0 ExitCode=137\r\n"]
[16.718779, "o", "    \u001b[90matteso: exited, RestartCount=0, ExitCode=137 — «restart: unless-stopped» NON lo rialza\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[90mè la domanda che arriva dal pubblico, ed è nella pagina delle trappole (ADR-0033)\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[90mper rimetterlo in piedi: ./tools/reset-demo.sh 02\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[16.71882, "o", "\r\nLe righe di log che lo raccontano\r\n    \u001b[90msi cercano per id, mai per testo del messaggio (ADR-0035)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[16.718897, "o", "    \u001b[90mlog di mongo-rs-2, il nodo eletto\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[17.195185, "o", "  12:18:42.271  id=21216    REPL     Member is now in state DOWN\r\n"]
[17.195784, "o", "  12:18:50.818  id=4615652  ELECTION Starting an election, since we've seen no PRIMARY in election timeout period\r\n  12:18:50.818  id=21438    ELECTION Conducting a dry run election to see if we could be elected\r\n  12:18:50.820  id=51799    ELECTION VoteRequester processResponse\r\n  12:18:50.820  id=21444    ELECTION Dry election run succeeded, running for election\r\n"]
[17.195848, "o", "  12:18:50.820  id=6015300  ELECTION Storing last vote document in local storage for my election\r\n  12:18:50.824  id=51799    ELECTION VoteRequester processResponse\r\n  12:18:50.824  id=21450    ELECTION Election succeeded, assuming primary role\r\n  12:18:50.824  id=21358    REPL     Replica set state transition\r\n"]
